00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:34.530
<b>Beautiful Wings</b>

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:38.910
<b>Oh, the ant's working hard to carry its food...</b>

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.050
<b>You've got it tough there.</b>

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:44.840
<b>What are you still doing there?</b>

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.220
<b>Come on already, Shō.</b>

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:49.460
<b>Okay Sensei!</b>

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.350
<b>These wingless creeping bugs would be much happier,</b>

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:59.110
<b>if they're simply crushed by someone, right?</b>

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:02.550
<b>Yahoo~! I can see it already.</b>

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.600
<b>Sensei, it's that ship right?</b>

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.690
<b>Oh they sure did a good job masking it as a passenger boat,</b>

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:09.490
<b>but that muscle on the hatchway gives it all away.</b>

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:12.220
<b>So much that it might sink under their weight!</b>

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:13.610
<b>Indeed, Shō.</b>

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.980
<b>Your observational capability is quite impressive.</b>

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:16.900
<b>That's good.</b>

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.820
<b>Thanks, Sensei.</b>

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.540
<b>Anyway, Shō.</b>

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.050
<b>What is it, Sensei?</b>

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.230
<b>Get down, it's annoying.</b>

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:26.050
<b>Okay, Sensei!</b>

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:35.960
<b>Exalted God Fist, we welcome your arrival.</b>

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:40.290
<b>Woah, you look like a skeleton, mister.</b>

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:45.640
<b>So <i>that</i>  brat, is the current favorite successor?</b>

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:56.300
<b>Everyone, my gratitude to you all who are in attendance today in my mobile stronghold.</b>

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.490
<b>I am deeply honored.</b>

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.050
<b>They've arrived.</b>

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:12.790
<b>Ah, welcome!</b>

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:16.030
<b>Exalted God Fist, Hongō Akira.</b>

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:18.340
<b>Apart from the first Shadow,</b>

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.060
<b>all members of the One Shadow Nine Fists are now here.</b>

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.140
<b>It's been a long time, Kensei.</b>

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:28.310
<b>Wow, this is my first time seeing nine masters gather under one roof.</b>

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:32.940
<b>It seems that Kanō Shō-kun has also grown quite remarkably during that time.</b>

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.290
<b>That's right, Sensei.</b>

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:37.180
<b>If your master allows it, come and study under me anytime you want.</b>

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:38.550
<b>I'll welcome you with open arms.</b>

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:39.580
<b>Okay, Sensei!</b>

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.320
<b>Anyway, Master Ro Jisei.</b>

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:47.780
<b>As ordered we pitted Ryōzanpaku's strongest disciple against Chichouken's strongest disciple,</b>

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:50.000
<b>but she was beaten in the end.</b>

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.600
<b>Is that so?</b>

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.990
<b>It all ended the way that I predicted it would.</b>

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:57.870
<b>Is that what we can actually call, "progressive"?</b>

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.500
<b>Simply defeating the enemy will not do.</b>

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:05.040
<b>Our objective is to train a disciple that will one day defeat the absolute strongest.</b>

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:08.720
<b>Killing him before he reaches his peak potential is absolutely unacceptable.</b>

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.840
<b>I understand that very well.</b>

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:14.710
<b>What I'm trying to say is that, no matter which disciple of ours challenges him,</b>

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:20.120
<b>that Shirahama boy would still put up a good fight nonetheless.</b>

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.780
<b>Hmph, a foolish thought.</b>

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:24.960
<b>Just because your disciple was defeated,</b>

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:29.070
<b>doesn't mean ours will be as well, Kensei.</b>

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.760
<b>Whoa there Miss,</b>

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:36.000
<b>where are you planning to go with that stolen data you just hid?</b>

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:40.270
<b>My apologies, it looks like a filthy bug has infiltrated our haven.</b>

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.030
<b>My, oh my.</b>

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:44.600
<b>We do have quite a few adversaries in the shadows as well.</b>

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.540
<b>There she is, capture her!</b>

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.410
<b>Dammit, she's going to escape through the window!</b>

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.210
<b>Nice moves you've got there.</b>

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.100
<b><i>When did he...</i></b>

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.370
<b>Nice work, don't let her go.</b>

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.840
<b>Oh well, here you go Miss. <i>Bon Voyage!</i></b>

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:07.710
<b>Being nice to girls,</b>

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:09.540
<b>was one of the many things taught to me by my elementary teacher.</b>

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:16.770
<b>You...!</b>

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.300
<b>What have you just done?!</b>

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:21.950
<b>Hey, don't get too close, you look scary Mr. Skeleton.</b>

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:24.460
<b>Shō, enough with your tricks.</b>

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.830
<b>Alright Sensei.</b>

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:30.130
<b>Gone?!</b>

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.090
<b>Since when did he...?</b>

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.650
<b>Here, you can have this.</b>

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:36.740
<b>I've just stopped the enemy from extracting data from us.</b>

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:39.920
<b>Hongō-sensei, praise me please!</b>

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:40.870
<b>Yea.</b>

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:42.200
<b><i>That was fast.</i></b>

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:45.250
<b><i>There wasn't any visual trace of when he retrieved it.</i></b>

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.020
<b>Disciple of Ryōzanpaku, huh?</b>

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.950
<b>I don't know why but I feel like smashing him to bits.</b>

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:01.290
<b>Miu-san!</b>

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:03.110
<b>Miu-san!</b>

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.430
<b>Miu-san!</b>

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.090
<b>Miu-san!</b>

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.690
<b>Miu-san!~</b>

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:15.940
<b>Hey, don't just walk away like nothing's happening Tanimoto-kun.</b>

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:17.250
<b>Let go of me!</b>

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:24.320
<b>Prince Tanimoto!</b>

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.560
<b>Hi!</b>

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:28.260
<b>You two-faced transfer pretty boy!</b>

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:31.430
<b>Kenichi-san, I'm sorry.</b>

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.190
<b>Miu-san.</b>

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.950
<b>Thanks, Tanimoto-kun.</b>

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:39.340
<b>What's wrong, Miu-san?</b>

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:40.170
<b>You were spacing out earlier.</b>

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:43.410
<b>It's nothing, I wasn't really spacing–</b>

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.540
<b>Please excuse me.</b>

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.440
<b>Miu is acting strange?</b>

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:52.960
<b>Oh, so it's that time of the year already.</b>

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:54.910
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:55.770
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.830
<b>She's always like that during this time.</b>

00:06:58.830 --> 00:06:59.950
<b>She's always like that during this time.</b>

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:01.840
<b>It can't be helped.</b>

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:05.940
<b>It'll be the anniversary of her parents' death tomorrow.</b>

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:08.890
<b><i>That's it.</i></b>

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:13.330
<b><i>She lost her parents when she was little and was raised by the Elder.</i></b>

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:15.150
<b>I feel for her.</b>

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:17.960
<b>That's why I have been a father of sorts to her ever since she got here.</b>

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:19.960
<b>You big fat I-must-capture-her-"semi-naked"-moment liar!</b>

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.210
<b><i>Oh no!~</i></b>

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:22.980
<b>Why you...!</b>

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:24.910
<b>I'll add thirty minutes more to this!</b>

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:26.690
<b>Hey!</b>

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.990
<b>No chatting during training!</b>

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:32.850
<b>Bite your tongue, and we won't have enough electricity to run Ryōzanpaku.</b>

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:37.300
<b>Miu said that our electric bill went down.</b>

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:39.290
<b>She was quite happy about it.</b>

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:44.850
<b>I understand that she'd feel down on the day of her parent's death,</b>

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:46.890
<b>but she doesn't look like she's mourning for them,</b>

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:50.110
<b>rather it looks more like she's worried about something.</b>

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.970
<b>When did her parents die exactly?</b>

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:58.610
<b>Maybe something about their deaths is worrying her.</b>

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:00.530
<b>I'm adding twenty more minutes!</b>

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.230
<b>You insensitive disciple!</b>

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.180
<b>This situation isn't something that outsiders should just carelessly barge into.</b>

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:12.400
<b>Please save me~!</b>

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:20.930
<b>Come right in~...</b>

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.950
<b>Are you decent, Kenichi-san?</b>

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:24.660
<b>Miu-san?</b>

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:25.870
<b>Yes, it's okay!</b>

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.070
<b>Here, have some tea.</b>

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:35.450
<b>Wait this is pulpwood!</b>

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:39.380
<b>Too corny, huh? Ofcourse it was...</b>

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:42.620
<b>Umm, if it's okay with you,</b>

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:45.900
<b>can you come with me to visit a grave tomorrow?</b>

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:52.270
<b>I somewhat feel uneasy whenever I stand before that grave.</b>

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:53.970
<b>I wonder why?</b>

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.340
<b>Strange, isn't it?</b>

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:59.050
<b>I usually go with Grandpa,</b>

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.840
<b>but if you were also to go with me...</b>

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.740
<b>If I were also to go with you...?</b>

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:06.750
<b>I'd feel a bit more at ease.</b>

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.070
<b>If you're okay with me, I'll go anywhere with you.</b>

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:11.500
<b><i>Miu-san...</i></b>

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.920
<b>I wonder why...</b>

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:15.130
<b>I wonder why I'd feel better?</b>

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:16.400
<b>Is it because of his face?</b>

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.110
<b>Is it the outlines of his face?</b>

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:19.660
<b>Somehow it sounds weirdly rude.</b>

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:24.660
<b>Apa, Apa...</b>

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:28.120
<b>Ah, you finally came.</b>

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.220
<b>Hurry up!</b>

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.560
<b>I'm sorry, I couldn't decide on what to wear,</b>

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:32.920
<b>so I just went with my school uniform.</b>

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:37.070
<b>We're not attending a funeral so you don't need to be formal.</b>

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.050
<b>Well...</b>

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:45.030
<b><i>Her eyes, which reflect the surrounding scenery,</i></b>

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:49.990
<b><i>were colored with feelings of loneliness and the anticipation of meeting a beloved one.</i></b>

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:52.560
<b>Wait, why aren't we riding a bus?!</b>

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:55.140
<b>The shrine we're going to is in a far, remote place.</b>

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:57.000
<b>The route taken by a vehicle would be much farther.</b>

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.490
<b>That's why I told you to hurry up.</b>

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:07.890
<b><i>I will definitely protect Miu-san.</i></b>

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:10.310
<b><i>Someday, once I get stronger.</i></b>

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.380
<b><i>I guess that doesn't really inspire much confidence now, does it?</i></b>

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:17.750
<b><i>I wonder why.</i></b>

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:22.640
<b><i>Within her tears, there's something hidden that's more than just mere sorrow.</i></b>

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.160
<b><i>Or so I felt at least.</i></b>

