Fūrinji Shizuha

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:32.980
Fūrinji Shizuko

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:34.530
<b><i>Wait...</i></b>

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.740
<b><i>Her father's name isn't here.</i></b>

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:41.900
<b>Miu, I'm going to go pay my regards to the head priest.</b>

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:43.570
<b>Both of you go home now.</b>

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:49.880
<b>Umm, Miu-san.</b>

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.510
<b>Anyway, it's a nice weather, isn't it?</b>

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:56.670
<b>It'd be such a waste if we went straight back home.</b>

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.070
<b>Oh yes.</b>

00:10:58.140 --> 00:11:00.630
<b>Why don't we go out somewhere together?</b>

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:05.220
<b>As in, <i>eloping</i>  together somewhere?!</b>

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.550
<b>No, I don't mean it in that sense, Kenichi-san.</b>

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:09.170
<b>We're going to go have some fun.</b>

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:12.640
<b>As in, <i>a date?!</i></b>

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:14.740
<b>Where should we go?</b>

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.480
<b>Where, where?!</b>

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:19.210
<b>Well, well, I'm still not mentally prepared for this...</b>

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:21.160
<b><i>Anyway, let's go!</i></b>

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.030
<b>So they really are here.</b>

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.160
<b>The intel that I got was pretty accurate.</b>

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:30.030
<b>I'll be spotted if I get any closer.</b>

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:31.790
<b>He's one scary entity...</b>

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.070
<b>Whoops.</b>

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.240
<b>That was close.</b>

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:38.570
<b>Already I came here without telling Sensei.</b>

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:42.180
<b>He's going to kill me if he ever finds out that I came into contact with the guys from Ryōzanpaku.</b>

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.860
<b>Anyway, those two that he brought along...</b>

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:46.890
<b>That guy...</b>

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.740
<b>Oh, found the bug.</b>

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:56.250
<b>As for them... I guess I can get a little closer.</b>

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:13.970
<b>This is my first time in a botanical garden.</b>

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:14.980
<b><i>I'm sorry Miu-san.</i></b>

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:19.500
<b>It was so sudden that I just came straight to a place that I liked.</b>

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:23.580
<b>Places like Odaiba or Roppongi Hills would have been a lot better.</b>

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:24.540
<b><i>What are you saying?</i></b>

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:27.650
<b>You've already brought me to such a beautiful place.</b>

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:31.930
<b>Wow, this is amazing!</b>

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:34.180
<b>There really are lots of flowers here!</b>

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:35.600
<b><i><i>Huh? She's really happy about it?!</i></i></b>

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.030
<b><i>Maybe I should have just showed her around instead of being embarrassed about it.</i></b>

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:40.060
<b>Hey, look at this rose!</b>

00:12:40.060 --> 00:12:41.380
<b>It's named Samurai!</b>

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.030
<b>Yep, that came from France.</b>

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.820
<b>And this rose smells like soap.</b>

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:49.180
<b>It's the opposite.</b>

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:51.940
<b>Soap gets its scent from that rose.</b>

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:55.650
<b>Look, that tree grows its fruit at the trunk.</b>

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.310
<b>Oh, that's a cacao tree.</b>

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:00.530
<b>Chocolate is made from it.</b>

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.960
<b>What? From these weird-looking fruits?</b>

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:08.010
<b>Maybe my favorite <i>Anmitsu</i>  is also inside?</b>

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:08.010
<b>Note: Anmitsu is a Japanese dessert containing agar jelly mixed with a variety of fruits.</b>

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:08.940
<b>No, it's not.</b>

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:12.510
<b>Kenichi-san, you sure are quite knowledgeable about these things, aren't you?</b>

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:16.480
<b>I actually thought you were just some bum who always got pushed around.</b>

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:17.460
<b>That's just rude, you know?</b>

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.520
<b>I've loved books since I was a child.</b>

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.320
<b>When I didn't have anything else to read, I'd read encyclopedias.</b>

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:24.500
<b><i>Onii-chan, let's play!</i></b>

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.210
<b>So I learned a lot of things.</b>

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:30.510
<b>In any case, it has been a long time since I've had fun like this.</b>

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:32.820
<b><i>I'm glad that she looks cheerful now.</i></b>

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:35.620
<b>Oh, there are more beautiful flowers over there!</b>

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:40.020
<b><i>But that grave really didn't have her father's name written on it.</i></b>

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:44.600
<b>Umm, Miu-san, about our visit to the grave earlier–</b>

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:47.630
<b>Miu-san?</b>

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.920
<b>Kenichi-san!</b>

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.940
<b>Kenichi-san!</b>

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:54.210
<b>Oh no, this is bad!</b>

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:56.040
<b>Kenichi is lost!</b>

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:58.370
<b>Kenichi-san!</b>

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:00.380
<b>Kenichi... san...?</b>

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:06.860
<b>Poor thing.</b>

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.450
<b>That bird...!</b>

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.470
<b><i>Oh crap.</i></b>

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:21.060
<b><i>I have a bad habit of losing focus completely whenever I get distracted.</i></b>

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:24.720
<b><i>I hate ground creeping bugs, but I love birds so I just...</i></b>

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:28.100
<b>Seems like its leg has been caught in a fishing line.</b>

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:31.780
<b><i>I ended up running into someone from the Ryōzanpaku.</i></b>

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:34.570
<b><i>If Sensei finds out, he'll kill me.</i></b>

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:36.450
<b><i>I'm going to save that bird, then disappear!</i></b>

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.510
<b><i>Wings?</i></b>

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:48.020
<b><i>A person with wings?</i></b>

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:57.350
<b>Can you hold the bird there for me?</b>

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.920
<b>Good thing we found it in time.</b>

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.040
<b>It isn't injured that much.</b>

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:10.610
<b>Anyway, those sure were some great athletic moves.</b>

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:12.790
<b>Are you a practitioner of martial arts as well?</b>

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:14.340
<b>I found you!</b>

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:16.510
<b>I've been looking for somebody like you!</b>

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:18.230
<b>Huh?</b>

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:20.500
<b>My name is Kanō Shō.</b>

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.800
<b>Let us fly together, towards the wide and dark skies!</b>

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:24.990
<b>Dark?</b>

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:25.940
<b>That's right.</b>

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.170
<b>I'm sure the darkness will welcome you.</b>

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.600
<b>Could you be an assassin from the Yami organization?</b>

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.410
<b>Get away from me!</b>

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.470
<b>That was close!</b>

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:37.400
<b>Your moves sure look like Fūrinji Saiga's.</b>

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:38.600
<b>Fūrinji Saiga?</b>

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:40.690
<b>Do you know him?</b>

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.610
<b>Yeah, of course.</b>

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:45.470
<b>Yami organization collects a lot of information from a vast number of sources.</b>

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:49.780
<b>I'll tell you everything that you'd like to know.</b>

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.730
<b>Come with me, just for a little while.</b>

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.250
<b>Miu-san!</b>

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:58.380
<b>Geez, where could she have gone to?</b>

00:15:58.380 --> 00:16:01.890
<b>Maybe she got bored at the botanical garden and left?</b>

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:06.410
<b>Miu-san!</b>

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:07.340
<b>Kenichi-san!</b>

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:14.280
<b>Miu-san!</b>

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:17.670
<b>Those eyes...</b>

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:20.430
<b>Those eyes that I saw earlier...</b>

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.680
<b>Were eyes that were telling me to save her.</b>

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.090
<b>I'm certain of it!</b>

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:27.110
<b>Freeze you kidnapper!</b>

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:31.600
<b><i>I've finally met someone who matches my pair of wings!</i></b>

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:33.760
<b><i>With you, I feel like I can fly high.</i></b>

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.810
<b>Hold on tight.</b>

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:38.560
<b><i>I can fly wherever I want to!</i></b>

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.920
<b>I won't let you escape!</b>

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:44.800
<b>I'm going to chase you down to the depths of hell!</b>

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:46.810
<b>We're going to soar!</b>

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.020
<b><i>Kenichi-san, I'm sorry.</i></b>

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:56.310
<b>I really need to know every piece of information about Fūrinji Saiga, my father...</b>

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.480
<b>I've finally shaken him off.</b>

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:02.400
<b>Fūrinji Miu.</b>

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.220
<b>Let's take off and fly towards the dark skies!</b>

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:07.370
<b>I won't let you escape!</b>

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:13.020
<b>Ultra short– cut!</b>

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.470
<b>How's that?!</b>

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:19.890
<b>I stopped it using my body!</b>

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:21.870
<b>Oh no, Miu-san!</b>

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.780
<b><i>His moves are similar to hers!</i></b>

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:30.180
<b>My bike!</b>

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:34.310
<b>You...!</b>

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:37.870
<b>You're just a ground creeping bug, so stop acting like a bird!</b>

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.510
<b>Shut up kidnapper!</b>

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:40.830
<b>Give Miu-san back!</b>

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.630
<b>Kidnapper, degenerate, jerk!</b>

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.730
<b>Stop fucking around.</b>

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.800
<b>I'm starting to get really mad.</b>

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.180
<b><i>What was that?</i></b>

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:56.260
<b><i>It's an intense lethal aura!</i></b>

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.790
<b><i>This guy's no ordinary man.</i></b>

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:00.420
<b>Move out of the way.</b>

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:02.320
<b>I'll kill you.</b>

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.660
<b><i>Compared to my master's,</i></b>

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:09.020
<b><i>this aura is nothing!</i></b>

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:11.990
<b>You're the one who's going to move!</b>

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:16.720
<b>Damn.</b>

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:18.110
<b>Kenichi-san!</b>

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:22.270
<b>Tanimoto-kun, why are you here?</b>

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:24.340
<b>Look at your opponent hard before you pick a fight.</b>

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:24.970
<b>Fool.</b>

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:29.210
<b>Long time no see, Kanō Shō.</b>

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.730
<b>Or should I say, Sparna, leader of Yomi, and one of Yami's martial artists.</b>

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.730
<b>Note: Sparna or Garuda is a mythological bird in the Hindu mythology famed for having beautiful wings.</b>

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:35.580
<b>Indeed, the beautiful winged one.</b>

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.030
<b>Yami?</b>

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:38.700
<b>Tanimoto-kun, get off me!</b>

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:39.990
<b>Just shut yourself up!</b>

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:42.650
<b>Been quite a while, Hermit.</b>

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:45.360
<b>Don't stop me now, I'm about to crush that bug.</b>

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:46.920
<b>Are you really fine with that?</b>

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:48.870
<b>God Fist will definitely kill you.</b>

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:50.950
<b>Sensei will...?</b>

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.510
<b>Oh no, I completely forgot.</b>

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:54.570
<b>Hmph.</b>

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:56.610
<b>Let's go Miu!</b>

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:59.270
<b>Don't go, Miu-san!</b>

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:03.250
<b>I'm not sure what's worrying you,</b>

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:06.050
<b>and I'm not even sure if I can really help, but...</b>

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:09.070
<b>I...</b>

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:11.210
<b>But someday I surely will...!</b>

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.050
<b><i>Hey settle down!</i></b>

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:16.410
<b>I'm going to become stronger!</b>

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:19.560
<b>As a man, and as a martial artist!</b>

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:23.290
<b>I'm going to protect Miu-san!</b>

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:27.940
<b>That's why, please don't rely on them!</b>

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:32.030
<b>What's wrong, Miu?</b>

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:36.550
<b><i>That's right, don't do it.</i></b>

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:38.710
<b><i>You won't be able to come back once you step into that dark world.</i></b>

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:40.570
<b>Miu?</b>

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.220
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:43.570
<b>Is that so?</b>

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:46.050
<b>I shouldn't be too pushy with girls.</b>

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.220
<b>I can't do anything for now.</b>

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:49.430
<b>See you then.</b>

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.090
<b>No need to rush things.</b>

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:55.990
<b>You'll learn about it someday,</b>

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:59.380
<b>and realize that you're supposed to be with us.</b>

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.290
<b>I'm going to wait till then.</b>

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:02.690
Bloody tears

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:03.700
Bloody tears

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:12.160
<b>Until that time then.</b>

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:16.140
<b>LET ME GO! GODDAMMIT!</b>

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:17.660
<b>He just kissed her, didn't he?!</b>

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:19.170
<b><i>He's way too powerful for you right now.</i></b>

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:20.630
<b>You got a new lease on life.</b>

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:23.600
<b>In all honesty even I was a bit tense back there as well.</b>

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:30.190
<b>Jeez, after making it look like he wanted to be my friend,</b>

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:34.190
<b>he started pushing me to join Yami.</b>

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:36.830
<b>Is that right...~?</b>

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.710
<b><i>I-I'm telling the truth!</i></b>

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:39.500
<b>Just believe what she's saying,</b>

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.380
<b>even if it's a lie.</b>

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:43.610
<b>Sorry for making you worry.</b>

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:48.400
<b>No, it's okay!</b>

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.850
<b>I don't mind. Actually I've forgotten about it already!</b>

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:54.460
<b>Oh yeah, Tanimoto-kun,</b>

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:56.180
<b>what's with you and that guy?</b>

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:57.950
<b>You seem to know him quite well.</b>

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:01.000
<b>Y-Yeah, I knew him from my Ragnarok days.</b>

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.340
<b>I've also done my research about the Yami organization.</b>

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:06.230
<b>Anyway, why are you even here?</b>

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:07.890
<b>Natsu!</b>

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:09.780
<b>Natsu~!</b>

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:11.010
<b>Honoka!</b>

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.360
<b>Huh? Onii-chan and Big Boobs as well?</b>

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:17.940
<b>Honoka, what are you doing in the botanical garden?</b>

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:20.250
<b>I'm going to have a picnic with him of course!</b>

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.010
<b>Eh, who?</b>

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:26.650
<b>I defeated him at Othello so I had him tag along with me!</b>

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.560
